   e. copy, take, share or use the Software without a valid license.

4. Resale or Redistribution of a Changed Version

   The Customer may sell or redistribute its own changed version of the
   Software only when all of these are true:

   a. at least 30% (thirty percent) of the source code files of the Software
      have been substantially changed, rewritten or replaced with the
      Customer's own work. Renaming, reformatting, rebranding, translating,
      reordering, changing colors, text or assets, or other cosmetic edits do
      not count as changes;
   b. the changed version is not offered as a starter kit, boilerplate,
      template or theme that competes with AmarEcommerce Lite;
   c. this license notice stays in the parts that come from the Software.

   The Customer must keep proof of the changes (for example version control
   history) and must show it to SIOKRAFT on written request. If the Customer
   cannot show the changes meet Section 4a, the resale or redistribution is
   not allowed.

